
Parameter: device_exx
Type:      String
Default:   cpu
Category:  Exact Exchange (LCAO)
Availability: basis_type==lcao

Description:
  Selects the LibRI tensor-contraction device for LCAO Kohn-Sham exact
  exchange.
  - cpu: retain CPU contractions, including when device=gpu.
  - gpu: use the experimental GPU backend; requires
    ENABLE_LIBRI_GPU=ON and device=gpu.
  Real-space EXX symmetry reduction is supported with symmetry=1 and
  exx_symmetry_realspace=1. Independent LR and RDMFT exchange engines
  retain CPU contractions. LR inherits this selection only when it
  reuses the Kohn-Sham exchange object. For GPU contractions, all MPI
  ranks on a node must see the same allocated GPU list, with at least
  as many visible GPUs as local ranks; per-rank single-GPU masking is
  unsupported.

